 "html": "<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(48px,7vw,96px);padding-bottom:clamp(48px,6vw,80px)\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:#4C4A66\"><a href=\"/\" style=\"color:#4C4A66\">Home</a><span>/</span><a href=\"/for-growing-businesses\" style=\"color:#4C4A66\">Solutions</a><span>/</span><span style=\"color:#3B2ED3\">Pay contractors in Africa</span></nav><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(34px, 2.2vw + 26px, 58px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.045em;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 0;max-width:16ch\">Pay contractors and employees in Africa<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:.2em;height:.2em;margin-left:.06em;background:#FFB224\"></span></h1><p style=\"font-size:clamp(17px,1.4vw,19px);line-height:1.55;color:#4C4A66;margin:24px 0 0;max-width:58ch\">Pay your team in 20 African countries in their own currency, to the mobile money wallet or bank account they prefer, from one USD, EUR, GBP or stablecoin balance.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px\"><a href=\"/contact\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff\" class=\"dp-1uxoczp\">Talk to sales</a><a href=\"/#platform\" style=\"padding:16px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:16px;font-weight:500;background:#F6F4EF;color:#131126\" class=\"dp-1u9awz2\">See the platform →</a></div><div style=\"margin-top:40px;max-width:760px;padding:22px 24px;border-radius:20px;background:#F6F4EF\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4C4A66\"><span style=\"width:8px;height:8px;background:#5ED6B4\"></span>In short</div><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6\">Companies pay African contractors and employees with ElementPay by uploading a payout file or calling the API, funding in USD, EUR, GBP or USDC and USDT, and delivering local currency to mobile money or bank in 20 countries.</p></div></section>\n<div style=\"background:#F6F4EF\">\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Who uses it.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Remote-first companies</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Pay engineers, designers and support teams in Africa.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">EOR and payroll providers</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Add African payouts to your platform.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">Agencies</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Pay freelancers per project.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">NGOs</h3><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#4C4A66;margin:10px 0 0\">Pay field staff and partners.</p></div></div></section>\n<section style=\"max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-right:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);padding-top:clamp(64px,8vw,112px)\"><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(28px, 1.5vw + 22px, 44px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-0.04em;font-weight:700;margin:0\">How it works.</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px\"><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#3B2ED3;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">01</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px 0 0\">Add your team</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">Upload a file or sync from your HR tool.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#FFB224;color:#131126\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">02</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px 0 0\">Fund</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:inherit;opacity:.85;margin:8px 0 0\">USD, EUR, GBP or stablecoins.</p></div><div style=\"padding:28px;border-radius:28px;background:#7C6FFF;color:#131126\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-label),monospace;font-size:13px;color:inherit;opacity:.75\">03</span><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading),sans-serif;font-size:clamp(19px, 0.45vw + 17px, 24px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:12px